@crew v-tamura-keira
// Writer 4, batch 5: a short-stay visitor. Mostly not about work.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hello. Keira Tamura. I've brought seeds. Lots of seeds.
- Oh, hello. Do you know where the garden's warmest corner is?
? tier>=acquaintance
- {hi}, {me}. The cuttings took. All six. I nearly cried.   #warm
?

== chat
- The orchard on Kesh has a tree older than my gran. I've brought a bit of it.
- If the seeds take, you'll have plums by Lanterns. Well. Someone will.   #funny

== near
? place:hydroponics_garden
- Tove's shown me every bed by its sowing week. Lovely system.
? place:booths
- Calling the orchard. They want to know if the cuttings are homesick.   #funny
?

== bye
- {bye}. Say hello to the plum cuttings if you pass. They like company.   #funny

== smalltalk
- Grow, little ones.
- Plums by Lanterns. Maybe.
